WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:07.411 --> 00:00:08.578
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WELCOME BACK TO

00:00:08.579 --> 00:00:10.413
OUR SPECIAL "FRUMP THIS ASIA"

00:00:10.414 --> 00:00:11.347
EDITION OF "TUCKER CARLSON

00:00:11.348 --> 00:00:12.015
TONIGHT."

00:00:12.016 --> 00:00:13.283
WE ARE STANDING ON THE NORTH

00:00:13.284 --> 00:00:14.417
KOREAN BORDER.

00:00:14.418 --> 00:00:15.785
OUR INTERVIEW WITH THE

00:00:15.786 --> 00:00:17.253
PRESIDENT DIDN'T SIMPLY FOCUS

00:00:17.254 --> 00:00:20.089
ON FOREIGN POLICY OR DECAYS OF

00:00:20.090 --> 00:00:20.890
THE AMERICAN CITIES.

00:00:20.891 --> 00:00:22.058
YOU COULD FILL HOURS OF

00:00:22.059 --> 00:00:23.426
PROGRAMMING ON THOSE TOPICS.

00:00:23.427 --> 00:00:25.662
THE FEDERAL GOVERNMENT IS

00:00:25.663 --> 00:00:29.132
BEING INCREASELY OPEN OF THE

00:00:29.133 --> 00:00:31.267
DECADES' LONG INVESTIGATION OF

00:00:31.268 --> 00:00:31.868
U.F.O.s.

00:00:31.869 --> 00:00:33.269
OFFICIALS ADMIT NOW THEY HAVE

00:00:33.270 --> 00:00:35.171
SEEN MANY THINGS THEY DON'T

00:00:35.172 --> 00:00:35.772
UNDERSTAND.

00:00:35.773 --> 00:00:37.907
WE DECIDED TO ASK THE

00:00:37.908 --> 00:00:38.508
PRESIDENT ABOUT IT.

00:00:38.509 --> 00:00:40.877
HERE IS HIS SEMI-CRYPTIC

00:00:40.878 --> 00:00:41.644
ANSWER.

00:00:41.645 --> 00:00:43.279
YOU GAVE A INTERVIEW THE OTHER

00:00:43.280 --> 00:00:44.614
DAY WHERE YOU SAID YOU HAVE

00:00:44.615 --> 00:00:45.949
BEEN BRIEFED ON UNIDENTIFIED

00:00:45.950 --> 00:00:46.950
FLYING OBJECTS.

00:00:46.951 --> 00:00:47.851
ARE THEY REAL?

00:00:47.852 --> 00:00:48.518
&gt;&gt; President Trump: I DON'T

00:00:48.519 --> 00:00:50.019
WANT TO GET INTO IT TOO MUCH.

00:00:50.020 --> 00:00:51.054
PERSONALLY, I TEND TO DOUBT

00:00:51.055 --> 00:00:51.321
IT.

00:00:51.322 --> 00:00:52.488
I MEAN YOU HAVE PEOPLE THAT

00:00:52.489 --> 00:00:53.857
SWEAR BY IT, RIGHT?

00:00:53.858 --> 00:00:56.359
PILOTS HAVE COME IN AND THEY

00:00:56.360 --> 00:00:58.061
SAID -- AND THESE ARE PILOTS,

00:00:58.062 --> 00:00:59.929
NOT PILOTS THAT ARE INTO THAT

00:00:59.930 --> 00:01:00.730
PARTICULAR WORLD.

00:01:00.731 --> 00:01:02.665
BUT WE HAVE HAD PEOPLE SAYING

00:01:02.666 --> 00:01:06.236
THAT THEY HAVE SEEN THINGS.

00:01:06.237 --> 00:01:07.737
I'M NOT A BELIEVER BUT YOU

00:01:07.738 --> 00:01:08.571
KNOW, I GUESS ANYTHING IS

00:01:08.572 --> 00:01:09.005
POSSIBLE.

00:01:09.006 --> 00:01:10.206
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WE SPOKE TO A

00:01:10.207 --> 00:01:11.474
GOVERNMENT OFFICIAL RECENTLY

00:01:11.475 --> 00:01:13.176
WHO SAID THE U.S. GOVERNMENT

00:01:13.177 --> 00:01:14.544
HAD WRECKAGE FROM THE U.F.O.

00:01:14.545 --> 00:01:17.247
IN AN FACILITY ON AIR FORCE

00:01:17.248 --> 00:01:17.614
BASE.

00:01:17.615 --> 00:01:18.915
ARE YOU FAMILIAR WITH THAT?

00:01:18.916 --> 00:01:19.682
&gt;&gt; President Trump: I HAVE

00:01:19.683 --> 00:01:21.818
NOT HEARD THAT.

00:01:21.819 --> 00:01:23.119
IN THE GOVERNMENT, I HAVE NOT

00:01:23.120 --> 00:01:23.486
SEEN IT.

00:01:23.487 --> 00:01:25.255
I HAVE SEEN IT ON YOUR SHOW.

00:01:25.256 --> 00:01:27.390
BUT I DON'T ASSUME IT'S

00:01:27.391 --> 00:01:27.724
CORRECT.

00:01:27.725 --> 00:01:29.459
YOU KNOW, I HAVE AN OPEN MIND,

00:01:29.460 --> 00:01:29.893
TUCKER.

00:01:29.894 --> 00:01:30.994
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I KNOW YOU DO,

00:01:30.995 --> 00:01:31.427
MR. PRESIDENT.

00:01:31.428 --> 00:01:32.428
THANK YOU FOR THAT.

00:01:32.429 --> 00:01:33.796
&gt;&gt; President Trump: NOW DAYS

00:01:33.797 --> 00:01:37.367
YOU CAN BELIEVE ANYTHING,

00:01:37.368 --> 00:01:37.834
RIGHT?

00:01:37.835 --> 00:01:39.102
&gt;&gt; Tucker: NICK POPE IS A

00:01:39.103 --> 00:01:40.370
JOURNALIST AND HE ONCE

00:01:40.371 --> 00:01:41.738
INVESTIGATED U.F.O. SIGHTINGS

00:01:41.739 --> 00:01:43.239
FOR THE BRITISH MINISTRY OF

00:01:43.240 --> 00:01:44.407
DEFENSE AND HE JOINS US

00:01:44.408 --> 00:01:44.741
TONIGHT.

00:01:44.742 --> 00:01:46.142
NICK, I THOUGHT IT WAS AN

00:01:46.143 --> 00:01:47.076
INTERESTING ANSWER.

00:01:47.077 --> 00:01:48.978
THE PRESIDENT SAID HE HAD BEEN

00:01:48.979 --> 00:01:49.445
BRIEFED.

00:01:49.446 --> 00:01:52.215
"I DON'T WANT TO GET INTO IT."

00:01:52.216 --> 00:01:55.218
BUT HE IS SKEPTICAL THAT

00:01:55.219 --> 00:01:55.952
U.F.O.s ARE REAL.

00:01:55.953 --> 00:01:57.353
WHAT DOES THAT ADD UP TO,

00:01:57.354 --> 00:01:58.554
WOULD YOU SAY?

00:01:58.555 --> 00:02:00.189
&gt;&gt; WELL, FIRST OF ALL, I THINK

00:02:00.190 --> 00:02:01.691
IT'S ABSOLUTELY REFRESHING TO

00:02:01.692 --> 00:02:04.294
GET A STRAIGHT ANSWER FROM A

00:02:04.295 --> 00:02:04.827
PRESIDENT.

00:02:04.828 --> 00:02:07.130
A SITTING PRESIDENT ON THIS

00:02:07.131 --> 00:02:08.932
WITHOUT DODGING THE QUESTION.

00:02:08.933 --> 00:02:11.534
WITHOUT MAKING SOME HUMOROUS

00:02:11.535 --> 00:02:14.470
REFERENCE TO A SCIENCE FICTION

00:02:14.471 --> 00:02:14.771
MOVIE.

00:02:14.772 --> 00:02:16.072
THAT WAS GOOD TO HEAR.

00:02:16.073 --> 00:02:17.473
I UNDERSTAND THAT SKEPTICISM.

00:02:17.474 --> 00:02:18.641
I THINK EVERYONE THAT STARTED

00:02:18.642 --> 00:02:21.110
OFF LOOKING AT THIS WITHIN

00:02:21.111 --> 00:02:22.912
GOVERNMENT STARTS SKEPTICAL.

00:02:22.913 --> 00:02:26.616
BUT AS YOU SAY, THIS REFERENCE

00:02:26.617 --> 00:02:29.352
TO THE BRIEFING THAT HE HAD IS

00:02:29.353 --> 00:02:30.153
VERY INTERESTING.

00:02:30.154 --> 00:02:31.654
WHEN HE SAYS HE DOESN'T WANT

00:02:31.655 --> 00:02:33.156
TO GET INTO THIS, DOES THAT

00:02:33.157 --> 00:02:34.357
REFLECT JUST THAT HE IS

00:02:34.358 --> 00:02:35.825
PERSONALLY NOT THAT INTERESTED

00:02:35.826 --> 00:02:38.661
OR MAYBE THAT HE RECEIVED SOME

00:02:38.662 --> 00:02:39.595
CLASSIFIED INFORMATION THAT HE

00:02:39.596 --> 00:02:43.833
IS NOT ABLE TO SHARE ABOUT ALL

00:02:43.834 --> 00:02:44.367
THIS?

00:02:44.368 --> 00:02:46.769
&gt;&gt; Tucker: WE SPOKE TO A

00:02:46.770 --> 00:02:50.106
U.S., A CREDIBLE, NON-CRAZY

00:02:50.107 --> 00:02:51.240
U.S. OFFICIAL WHO SAID

00:02:51.241 --> 00:02:52.408
CATEGORICALLY FLAT OUT THE

00:02:52.409 --> 00:02:53.209
U.S. GOVERNMENT HAS WRECKAGE

00:02:53.210 --> 00:02:54.344
FROM A U.F.O.

00:02:54.345 --> 00:02:56.479
DIDN'T SAY IT WAS

00:02:56.480 --> 00:02:57.347
EXTRATERRESTRIAL.

00:02:57.348 --> 00:02:58.414
IT WAS AN UNIDENTIFIED FLYING

00:02:58.415 --> 00:02:59.115
OBJECT.

00:02:59.116 --> 00:03:01.985
AND THE U.S. GOVERNMENT HAS

00:03:01.986 --> 00:03:03.586
MATERIAL FROM THAT AIRCRAFT.

00:03:03.587 --> 00:03:05.388
WHATEVER IT IS.

00:03:05.389 --> 00:03:08.091
THAT IS AN AMAZING CLAIM.

00:03:08.092 --> 00:03:09.258
HOW WOULD THE PRESIDENT NOT

00:03:09.259 --> 00:03:11.394
HAVE HEARD THAT?

00:03:11.395 --> 00:03:13.029
ASSUMING IT'S TRUE.

00:03:13.030 --> 00:03:14.364
&gt;&gt; WELL, I THINK -- YEAH, I

00:03:14.365 --> 00:03:16.065
THINK THAT IS THE BIG THING.

00:03:16.066 --> 00:03:17.000
ASSUMING IT'S TRUE.

00:03:17.001 --> 00:03:18.501
I WOULD THINK THAT THE

00:03:18.502 --> 00:03:19.535
PRESIDENT HAS PROBABLY ASKED

00:03:19.536 --> 00:03:21.604
THE CHAIRMAN OF THE JOINT

00:03:21.605 --> 00:03:23.306
CHIEFS FIRSTLY, IS THERE A

00:03:23.307 --> 00:03:24.674
THREAT HERE TO THE UNITED

00:03:24.675 --> 00:03:26.542
STATES?

00:03:26.543 --> 00:03:28.811
AND SECONDLY SETTING THAT

00:03:28.812 --> 00:03:30.313
QUESTION ASIDE, WHAT ARE WE

00:03:30.314 --> 00:03:30.980
DEALING WITH?

00:03:30.981 --> 00:03:32.048
IS THIS OUR OWN TECH?

00:03:32.049 --> 00:03:33.049
IS IT RUSSIA?

00:03:33.050 --> 00:03:33.983
IS IT CHINA?

00:03:33.984 --> 00:03:35.685
OR IS IT FROM SOMEWHERE

00:03:35.686 --> 00:03:36.386
FURTHER AFIELD?

00:03:36.387 --> 00:03:39.522
I MEAN, HE WILL HAVE ASKED FOR

00:03:39.523 --> 00:03:44.260
ALL INFORMATION HELD ON THIS.

00:03:44.261 --> 00:03:45.495
AND WILL BE TRYING TO FIGURE

00:03:45.496 --> 00:03:46.529
OUT WHAT TO DO.

00:03:46.530 --> 00:03:48.598
HE HAS SAID HIMSELF SOMETHING

00:03:48.599 --> 00:03:51.200
FEELS A LITTLE BIT DIFFERENT

00:03:51.201 --> 00:03:51.667
WITH ALL THIS.

00:03:51.668 --> 00:03:53.302
WITH THE U.S. NAVY PILOTS AND

00:03:53.303 --> 00:03:55.238
THE RADAR OPERATORS NOW COMING

00:03:55.239 --> 00:03:55.805
FORWARD.

00:03:55.806 --> 00:03:58.174
THERE IS SOMETHING DIFFERENT,

00:03:58.175 --> 00:03:59.275
IMPORTANT AND BIG HAPPENING.

00:03:59.276 --> 00:04:00.376
&gt;&gt; Tucker: SO WHAT WOULD YOU

00:04:00.377 --> 00:04:01.778
SAY SINCE YOU SPEAK TO A LOT

00:04:01.779 --> 00:04:03.379
OF PEOPLE WHO ARE INVOLVED IN

00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:04.447
THIS, NOT JUST IN THE

00:04:04.448 --> 00:04:06.249
PROFESSIONAL U.F.O.

00:04:06.250 --> 00:04:07.383
QUESTIONING WORLD, WHICH I

00:04:07.384 --> 00:04:08.484
THINK MOST OF US HAVE A RIGHT

00:04:08.485 --> 00:04:11.354
TO BE A LITTLE SKEPTICAL OF.

00:04:11.355 --> 00:04:13.790
BUT ORDINARY PILOTS AND PEOPLE

00:04:13.791 --> 00:04:14.590
GOING ABOUT THEIR IT BE IN

00:04:14.591 --> 00:04:15.324
GOVERNMENT WHO HAVE

00:04:15.325 --> 00:04:16.259
INTERSECTED WITH THE STORIES

00:04:16.260 --> 00:04:17.460
OR SEEN THE ON THES

00:04:17.461 --> 00:04:19.595
THEMSELVES, WHAT IS THE

00:04:19.596 --> 00:04:21.097
MAJORITY VIEW ABOUT WHAT THESE

00:04:21.098 --> 00:04:21.664
ARE?

00:04:21.665 --> 00:04:24.467
RUSSIAN, CHINESE, AMERICAN OR

00:04:24.468 --> 00:04:25.535
SOMETHING ELSE?

00:04:25.536 --> 00:04:28.504
&gt;&gt; WELL, I'M NOT SURE THERE IS

00:04:28.505 --> 00:04:29.739
A MAJORITY VIEW.

00:04:29.740 --> 00:04:30.440
EVEN WITHIN GOVERNMENT.

00:04:30.441 --> 00:04:31.741
I HAVE BEEN HERE MYSELF WITH

00:04:31.742 --> 00:04:33.009
THE BRITISH MINISTRY OF

00:04:33.010 --> 00:04:33.443
DEFENSE.

00:04:33.444 --> 00:04:35.144
THERE WERE CONFLICTING

00:04:35.145 --> 00:04:35.511
OPINIONS.

00:04:35.512 --> 00:04:37.447
I MEAN, LOOK, IF THE PRESIDENT

00:04:37.448 --> 00:04:39.348
WOULD LIKE MORE RESEARCH AND

00:04:39.349 --> 00:04:41.617
MORE BRIEFING, I'M CERTAINLY

00:04:41.618 --> 00:04:42.885
HAPPY TO HELP WITH THAT.

00:04:42.886 --> 00:04:44.187
YOU COULD PROBABLY ROUND UP A

00:04:44.188 --> 00:04:45.755
COUPLE OF FORMER INTELLIGENCE

00:04:45.756 --> 00:04:47.790
OFFICIALS FROM WITHIN THE

00:04:47.791 --> 00:04:48.458
U.S. ADMINISTRATION TO WHO

00:04:48.459 --> 00:04:49.325
HAVE LOOKED AT THIS.

00:04:49.326 --> 00:04:53.062
AND WE COULD CERTAINLY, I'M

00:04:53.063 --> 00:04:54.430
SURE, YOU KNOW, GET PEOPLE

00:04:54.431 --> 00:04:55.865
AFRAID WHO ARE NOT AFRAID TO

00:04:55.866 --> 00:04:57.700
THINK THE UNTHINKABLE AND ASK

00:04:57.701 --> 00:05:01.037
THE PEOPLE WHAT IF QUESTIONS.

00:05:01.038 --> 00:05:02.538
BUT WHATEVER HAPPENS WITH

00:05:02.539 --> 00:05:03.840
U.F.O.s, IT MAY HAPPEN ON

00:05:03.841 --> 00:05:04.640
PRESIDENT TRUMP'S WATCH.

00:05:04.641 --> 00:05:06.375
WE MAY GET WITH THE CURRENT

00:05:06.376 --> 00:05:07.743
RADIO TELESCOPES, CERTAINLY

00:05:07.744 --> 00:05:09.545
WITH THE NEXT GENERATION

00:05:09.546 --> 00:05:11.013
TELESCOPES WE MIGHT GET

00:05:11.014 --> 00:05:13.983
ABSOLUTE CONFIRMATION THAT THE

00:05:13.984 --> 00:05:16.752
OTHER CIVILIZATIONS ARE OUT

00:05:16.753 --> 00:05:17.220
THERE.

00:05:17.221 --> 00:05:18.488
THEREFORE, IT MIGHT HAPPEN ON

00:05:18.489 --> 00:05:19.122
PRESIDENT TRUMP'S WATCH.

00:05:19.123 --> 00:05:21.090
HE WILL BE THE ONE WHO HAS TO

00:05:21.091 --> 00:05:22.225
MAKE AN ANNOUNCEMENT.

00:05:22.226 --> 00:05:23.793
WHAT AN HISTORIC ANNOUNCEMENT

00:05:23.794 --> 00:05:24.727
THAT WOULD BE.

00:05:24.728 --> 00:05:25.962
"MY FELLOW AMERICANS, PEOPLE

00:05:25.963 --> 00:05:27.463
OF THE WORLD, WE ARE NOT

00:05:27.464 --> 00:05:27.797
ALONE."

00:05:27.798 --> 00:05:30.433
SO I'M GLAD TO HEAR HE IS

00:05:30.434 --> 00:05:31.701
OPEN-MINDED AND THINKING ABOUT

00:05:31.702 --> 00:05:32.068
THIS.

00:05:32.069 --> 00:05:34.337
THERE HAS BEEN AN UP-SURGE IN

00:05:34.338 --> 00:05:35.838
THE SIGHTINGS AND WHO KNOWS

00:05:35.839 --> 00:05:38.608
WHAT THE FUTURE WILL BRING?

00:05:38.609 --> 00:05:39.342
&gt;&gt; Tucker: SOMETHING

00:05:39.343 --> 00:05:43.313
TERRIFYING ABOUT ALL THAT.

